              { "code": "M2", "text": "Alternatively, adds the probabilities of the six ordered different-colour outcomes." },
              { "code": "M1", "text": "Awarded for one correct product other than $\\frac{6}{20}\\times\\frac{5}{19}$." }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "total_marks": 7
    },
